# Composables & Stores

See `docs/agents/coding-standards.md` and `docs/agents/architecture.md`.

- Composables: `use*` prefix, return reactive state + actions
- API composables in `app/composables/api/` wrap `useApiClient()` for a resource
- Pinia stores for shared cross-component state (`auth`, `catalog`, `bookings`)
- Client API calls go to `/api/*` (BFF) — never to backend URL directly
- Return `{ data, error }` result objects — don't throw in composables unless intentional
